        "id": 1601121740,
        "content": "If it wasn't clear, the spec is to have nested inheritance for the entire config, not just for incentives. Ideally I'd like to get rid of every function in `helpers.ts` and just merge repo, org and default config using lodash - that way we don't need to keep adding new functions for every property.",
